      "thinking": "My Warden got bounced back to hand after Submersible blocked or triggered its bounce ability — it's now tapped with 3 counters from exhausting. Their lands are all tapped, likely from spending mana on their own turn before priority passed to me, so I can't assume they have open mana for tricks this turn.\n\
